  "instance_name": "mapping_001",
  "label": "The speaker wishes they could physically support someone, but their disability prevents them from standing.",
  "description": "The text 'i wish i could stand by you!' is mapped onto the visual of the woman in the wheelchair, implying that her physical disability (inability to stand) is the reason she cannot provide the physical support implied by the phrase. This creates an analogical mapping where the woman's physical state is projected as the cause of her inability to fulfill the metaphorical request of 'standing by you'.",
